USING is not supported
a distance function is required
an equality predicate is required
only one distance function is allowed
the distance function must take one column from each side
a constant join expression is rejected
a cross-side inequality in ON is rejected
RIGHT and FULL kinds are rejected
integer vectors are promoted to the floating point supertype
1	a
vectors without a native floating point supertype are rejected
nullable vector elements are rejected by the distance function
array sizes must match at execution time
the old analyzer is not supported
